rooms_desc ({"A beautiful lake is a sight to behold -- especially the one in front of you.You can see clearly to the bottom of the lake.  The way the moon glitters offof it, you are reminded of a scene of someone and his or her lost love,holding hands, sitting near the lake, looking up at the moon, and spendingtime together.  Such a scene can easily be reenacted here -- the lake is,by far, the most beautiful thing you've seen.The entrance to Sai's house is through a door to your north.  To your eastlies a toolshed, with a glowing field surrounding the door.  Upon closerinspection, you see sparks and such jumping off of the shed, as if a glyphof warding has been placed on that shed.","Sai's foyer is your average, run-of-the-mill foyer.  Its common featuresinclude an ornate chandelier hanging in the middle of the ceiling, andseveral portraits.  A portrait of Sai himself hangs on the northern wall,while on the eastern wall, smaller portraits of Sai's mother, father, andolder brother hang proudly in their places of honor.","You are inside Sai's toolshed.  Sai usually keeps stuff here that he cannotcarry, and when he stashes things here, he usually expects them to still behere when he comes back for them.Chances are, if you see this room, it means one of two things:     1) You're Sai.     2) You're an immortal.","This room, strangely, is also well-lit -- You guess Sai must like light.There are scrolls hanging from the walls of this room, with words writtenin nihonese.  The scrolls are numbered 1 through 6, and each contains somelittle word of advice that Sai's parents have passed to him.A plush red carpet covers the floor, and in the corner of the den, therestands a small statue.","All around you are trophies, made of solid gold.  Most of them are forkarate, though others are for miscellaneous things (dart throwing, botwirling, underwater basketweaving).  Over in one corner of the room is oneof Sai's old ninja robes, battered and bruised, but still holding.  Somewhatlike Sai himself, apparently.",0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"By a lake, before the entrance of Sai's house.","Foyer to Sai's","Inside Sai's Toolshed","Den at Sai's.","Trophy room at Sai's",0,0,0,0,0,})
