items ({({"house","A large, two story stone house, at north, where Sai lives.","lake","A clear crystaline lake.  You can even see fish swimming in it",}),({"portrait of sai","A portrait of Sai.  Handsome devil, isn't he...","portrait of sai's mother","Sai's mother is a pretty looking elven woman with long black hair.","portrait of sai's father","A human male, Sai's father looks strong and healthy.","portrait of sai's brother","Sai's brother, Andrew, deceased.  Killed in battle with a drow elf.",}),0,({"scroll 1","Translated from Nihonese: \"Sensei is always right.\"","scroll 2","Translated from Nihonese: \"If Sensei is ever wrong, look at scroll 1 again.\"","scroll 3","Translated from Nihonese: \"A Smith and Wesson beats four aces.\"","scroll 4","Translated: \"Treat a sai like you would a friend, or he'll hurt you, too.\"","scroll 5","The handwritten scroll reads: \"The only good orc is a dead orc.\"","scroll 6","Translated from Nihonese: \"Ceilbacy is not hereditary.\"","carpet","A smooth, red, plush carpet lies on the floor","statue","Sai's family emblem, made of marble, stands here - a set of crossed sais.",}),({"trophy","This one here appears to be a \"Son of the Year\" award from Sai's mother.","robes","A torn, battered ninja robe.  Sai wore this when he was a low level ninja.",}),0,0,0,0,0,})
